      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For clarification on the status updates on this post: We discovered a solution to this issue from an unrelated change, and went through some extensive internal verification to ensure this works as expected.\n\nThe underlying issue is related to color spaces and how the displays on certain Meta headsets are calibrated.\n\nFuture versions of VRChat should no longer have this color discrepency between headsets and versions.",
