  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a high saturation on Quest 2 standalone that affects the whole view. This makes a lot of visuals look bright. This issue is everywhere including the default VRChat Home world. VRC Camera is unaffected by the issue.\n\nStrangely this is not as prevalent on the Quest Pro. - from another user, don't have the hardware to test this.\n\nTested with a new installation of the Meta Quest 2 VRChat Release.\n\nQuest 2 Video:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/442815138706489357/1096973370337267784/VRC_SaturationIssue_Quest2.mp4",
